  "title": "UNIVERSAL STORY ON CLEAN-ENERGY INNOVATION",
  "summary": "The reports highlight India's advancements in solar energy expansion and job creation, with specific mentions of the 7 GW solar facility in Andhra Pradesh and the 20,000 jobs created. Meanwhile, the talks about the Tamil Nadu government's strategic initiatives and the role of clean energy in economic growth are also referenced.",
